{
 "name": "modules-tools-batch-sidecar-binding",
 "about": "同 modules-tools-batch-sidecar-stdio 的输入，但外部循环不是由 PILOTDECK_AGENT_LOOP_TRANSPORT=stdio 选的，而是 pilotdeck.yaml 的 modules.agentLoop 绑定 module-stdio-v2 指向本侧的 sidecar（/bin/sh -c 起 {SIDECAR}，环境里没有任何部署变量）。基线 createAgentLoopBindingFactory（AgentLoopDeploymentProfile.ts:107-127）按绑定的 command / args、以 process.env 加 binding.env 起子进程，循环在外部模块里跑，结果与 env 部署一致：整批被拒时 sidecar 自己的工具端口给每个调用一份 moduleFailureResult（hostToolPort.ts:211-213、357-376）。外部 agentLoop 与外部 tools 同时绑定时其余核心模块必须显式绑定（parseModulesConfig.ts:45-57），这里 skills / modelProvider / context 绑 pilotdeck、knowledge 关闭。",
 "volatile": [
  "^\\$\\.provider\\.m-b\\d+-\\d+\\[\\d+\\]\\.body\\.requestId$"
 ],
 "config": "schemaVersion: 1\nagent:\n  model: bbx/deterministic\n  maxContextTokens: 65536\n  maxOutputTokens: 8192\nmodel:\n  providers:\n    bbx:\n      protocol: openai\n      url: {MOCK}/v1\n      apiKey: bbx-mock-only\n      models:\n        deterministic:\n          capabilities:\n            supportsToolUse: true\n            maxContextTokens: 65536\n            maxOutputTokens: 8192\ntelemetry:\n  enabled: false\nmodules:\n  agentLoop:\n    enabled: true\n    implementationId: pilotdeck-agent-loop\n    contract: pilotdeck.agent-loop/v1\n    transport: module-stdio-v2\n    command: /bin/sh\n    args:\n      - -c\n      - 'eval \"exec $BBX_SIDECAR\"'\n  skills:\n    enabled: true\n    provider: pilotdeck\n  modelProvider:\n    enabled: true\n    provider: pilotdeck\n  context:\n    enabled: true\n    provider: pilotdeck\n  knowledge:\n    enabled: false\n  tools:\n    enabled: true\n    implementationId: bbx.tools\n    contract: pilotdeck.tools/v1\n    transport: module-http-v2\n    endpoint: {MOCK}/tools\n    timeoutMs: 1500\n    methods:\n      - execute\n      - execute_batch\n    catalog:\n      - name: bbx_echo\n        description: Echo text through the external capability module.\n        inputSchema:\n          type: object\n          properties:\n            text:\n              type: string\n          required:\n            - text\n      - name: bbx_lookup\n        description: Look a key up in the external capability module.\n        kind: search\n        readOnly: true\n        concurrencySafe: true\n        inputSchema:\n          type: object\n          properties:\n            key:\n              type: string\n",
